# React best practices

When building or changing React UI, hooks, state, effects, composition, or accessibility:

1. Read and follow [`.agents/skills/react-best-practices/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/react-best-practices/SKILL.md).
2. Match this app's stack (React 19, TanStack Router, Zustand, React Compiler guidance in the repo) when the skill conflicts with local patterns.
3. Behavior changes still require the test-driven-development skill.
